{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bliss aan — provider",
    "description": "Audience folder `provider/` (provider token from the Auth collection: register with `app=provider`, D37). Slice 3 (+ follow-up 3a: coverage, event-location confirmation). Her own application only.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Application",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Show my application",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application",
            "description": "Her application and account state (draft, submitted, needs_completion with the reviewer's note, active, suspended with the reason). 200. Response `data` (ApplicationResource): `id, status, status_label, editable, status_reason` (suspended only), `completion {items[], note, requested_at}` (needs_completion only), `notes[{id, note, created_at}]` (notes to her; internal notes never sent), `account_type(_label), display_name, legal_name, representative_name, representative_title, email, phone, bio, city{id,name}, started_year, services[{id,name}], coverage[{id,name}], documents[{document_type{id,name,is_required}, document{id,status,status_label,rejection_reason,file{name,mime,size,url (signed, 10 min)},uploaded_at}|null}], photos[{id,url,caption}], submitted_at, activated_at`. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update application",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application",
            "description": "Partial update; only sent fields change. Only in `draft`/`needs_completion` (else 409). Rules: account_type individual|establishment; display_name ≤60; legal_name ≤120, representative_name ≤60, representative_title ≤60 (cleared for individuals); email ≤120 (email); bio ≤400; city_id active city; started_year 1950–this year; service_ids[] active services (≤50); coverage_city_ids[] active cities (≤20). Empty strings → null. 200 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account_type\": \"establishment\",\n  \"display_name\": \"لمسة الفن\",\n  \"legal_name\": \"شركة لمسة الفن للمناسبات\",\n  \"representative_name\": \"نورة العتيبي\",\n  \"representative_title\": \"مالكة\",\n  \"email\": \"noura@example.com\",\n  \"bio\": \"تنسيق حفلات الزفاف منذ 2019\",\n  \"city_id\": 1,\n  \"started_year\": 2019,\n  \"service_ids\": [\n    1,\n    2\n  ],\n  \"coverage_city_ids\": [\n    1,\n    2\n  ]\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Attach document",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application/documents",
            "description": "Upload first with `POST shared/uploads` (context `provider_document`, private). `media_id` must be hers, of that context and unused; `document_type_id` an active type for her account type. Replaces the file of that type and resets it to `pending`. 201 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"document_type_id\": 1,\n  \"media_id\": 10\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove document",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application/documents/{{document_id}}",
            "description": "Her own document only (else 404). Editable states only. 200 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add work photo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application/photos",
            "description": "Upload with context `portfolio`. Up to 10 (D40). caption ≤200. 201 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"media_id\": 11,\n  \"caption\": \"زفاف 2025\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove work photo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application/photos/{{photo_id}}",
            "description": "200 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit / resubmit",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{provider_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/provider/application/submit",
            "description": "draft|needs_completion → submitted. 422 with field errors when something is missing (display_name, city_id, legal_name + representative_name for establishments, service_ids, coverage_city_ids, required documents). A second submit while under review → 409 INVALID_STATE. 200 + ApplicationResource. Errors: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED · 403 FORBIDDEN (not a provider) / ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED · 404 NOT_FOUND · 409 INVALID_STATE (not editable / wrong state) · 422 VALIDATION_FAILED."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Catalog",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
